{
    "title": "2ndLine - Second Phone Number",
    "description": "Staying connected shouldn\u2019t stress you out. Get a new phone number free with the US area code of your choice and start calling and texting freely to anywhere in the US and Canada.\r\n\r\nFREE TALK & TEXT NATIONWIDE: NO PHONE BILL\r\nStay connected with the 2ndLine free Wi-Fi calling and texting app\r\n\r\nSECOND PHONE NUMBER: FOR CALLING & TEXTING\r\nUse the 2ndLine calling and text messaging app as a free second phone line.\r\n\r\nINTERNATIONAL CALLING: 230+ COUNTRIES\r\nAre your friends and family overseas? 2ndLine offers free calls to Canada and low-cost international calls to 230+ countries with rates starting at less than $0.01 USD per minute. Cherish talk time with loved ones far away.\r\n\r\nWHY 2ndLine?\r\n\u2022 Free calling, free texting.\r\n\u2022 Call and text for free immediately when you download the 2ndLine app.\r\n\u2022 Get a local phone number. Area codes from most metro areas in the US available.\r\n\u2022 Voice call, direct message, picture and video messages to the US or Canada for free.\r\n\r\nHOW IS 2ndLine FREE?\r\nThere are no yearly or monthly fees to use 2ndLine. We partner with brands to pay for your phone calling and messaging (so you don\u2019t have to) with in-app ads. Ads won\u2019t interrupt your experience. If you don't like ads, you can purchase a subscription to remove them. If you don't like ads, you can purchase a subscription to remove them.\r\n\r\nMORE FEATURES\r\n\u2022 Caller ID\r\n\u2022 Customizable free text tones, call tones, ringtones, vibrations and phone backgrounds\r\n\u2022 Quick Reply to speedily respond to friends\r\n\u2022 A home screen widget for instant use\r\n\r\nChoose 2ndLine as your default dialer for a seamless calling experience. By granting access to your call logs, you'll be able to easily find and call your contacts in the 2ndLine app, view your call history, manage missed calls, and sync your 2ndLine message history across all your devices.\r\n\r\nTERMS OF USE AND PRIVACY POLICY\r\nThe use of 2ndLine is subject to accepting our terms of use (https://www.2ndline.co/terms) and privacy policy (https://www.2ndline.co/privacy ;  For California Residents: https://www.2ndline.co/privacy#california-privacy-rights).\r\n\r\n2ndLine is affiliated with TextNow Inc. 2ndLine is not affiliated with other texting and calling apps.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Staying connected shouldn\u2019t stress you out. Get a new phone number free with the US area code of your choice and start calling and texting freely to anywhere in the US and Canada.<br><br>FREE TALK &amp; TEXT NATIONWIDE: NO PHONE BILL<br>Stay connected with the 2ndLine free Wi-Fi calling and texting app<br><br>SECOND PHONE NUMBER: FOR CALLING &amp; TEXTING<br>Use the 2ndLine calling and text messaging app as a free second phone line.<br><br>INTERNATIONAL CALLING: 230+ COUNTRIES<br>Are your friends and family overseas? 2ndLine offers free calls to Canada and low-cost international calls to 230+ countries with rates starting at less than $0.01 USD per minute. Cherish talk time with loved ones far away.<br><br>WHY 2ndLine?<br>\u2022 Free calling, free texting.<br>\u2022 Call and text for free immediately when you download the 2ndLine app.<br>\u2022 Get a local phone number. Area codes from most metro areas in the US available.<br>\u2022 Voice call, direct message, picture and video messages to the US or Canada for free.<br><br>HOW IS 2ndLine FREE?<br>There are no yearly or monthly fees to use 2ndLine. We partner with brands to pay for your phone calling and messaging (so you don\u2019t have to) with in-app ads. Ads won\u2019t interrupt your experience. If you don&#39;t like ads, you can purchase a subscription to remove them. If you don&#39;t like ads, you can purchase a subscription to remove them.<br><br>MORE FEATURES<br>\u2022 Caller ID<br>\u2022 Customizable free text tones, call tones, ringtones, vibrations and phone backgrounds<br>\u2022 Quick Reply to speedily respond to friends<br>\u2022 A home screen widget for instant use<br><br>Choose 2ndLine as your default dialer for a seamless calling experience. By granting access to your call logs, you&#39;ll be able to easily find and call your contacts in the 2ndLine app, view your call history, manage missed calls, and sync your 2ndLine message history across all your devices.<br><br>TERMS OF USE AND PRIVACY POLICY<br>The use of 2ndLine is subject to accepting our terms of use (https://www.2ndline.co/terms) and privacy policy (https://www.2ndline.co/privacy ;  For California Residents: https://www.2ndline.co/privacy#california-privacy-rights).<br><br>2ndLine is affiliated with TextNow Inc. 2ndLine is not affiliated with other texting and calling apps.",
